                },
                "ImageDescription": {
                  "value": "Suddivisione dell'impero romano dal 22 maggio 337 (morte di <a href=\"https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Costantino_I\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"it:Costantino I\">Costantino I</a>) al 9 settembre dello stesso anno (proclamazione degli augusti).\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Costantino_II\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"it:Costantino II\"><span style=\"color:#c46c5c\">Costantino II</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Costante_I\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"it:Costante I\"><span style=\"color:#9edf44\">Costante I</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flavio_Dalmazio_(cesare)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"it:Flavio Dalmazio (cesare)\"><span style=\"color:#e1e342\">Flavio Dalmazio</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Costanzo_II\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"it:Costanzo II\"><span style=\"color:#9c649c\">Costanzo II</span></a></li></ul>\nPer modificare questa immagine, si prega di modificare prima  <a href=\"https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Immagine:Impero_Romano_da_maggio_a_settembre_337.svg\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"it:Immagine:Impero Romano da maggio a settembre 337.svg\">60px</a>",
                  "source": "commons-desc-page"
                },
                "DateTimeOriginal": {
                  "value": "23 August 2007 (original upload date)",
                  "source": "commons-desc-page"
                },
                "Credit": {
                  "value": "Page 40 of Division of Empire: The Reign of the Sons of Constantine by William Lewis (2024). \"As a result, Constantine II had Gaul, Spain, Britain, and Mauritania Tingitania; Constans had Italy, Africa, and Pannonia; and Constantius had the east. The only decision that had to be taken was the distribution of Dalmatius’ former territory. The solution was simply to allocate each of the two dioceses to the nearest adjacent territory, so Moesia went to Constans and Thrace went to Constantius.\"",
                  "source": "commons-desc-page"
                },
                "Artist": {
                  "value": "The original uploader was <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/it:User:Panairjdde\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:it:User:Panairjdde\">Panairjdde</a> at <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/it:\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:it:\">Italian Wikipedia</a>.",
